  (text "BQ25185 EVALUATION ONLY — no battery or processor board connected." (at 35 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6))) (uuid "b2518500-0000-4000-8000-000000000068"))
  (text "R1=130k sets 4.1V battery regulation and 500mA input limit per TI Rev.B Table 6-1. R2=4.3k gives about 70mA typical charge current; only a candidate screen for Renata ICP402025PC-01, not approved." (at 35 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "b2518500-0000-4000-8000-000000000069"))
  (text "TS/MR requires a 10k NTC at 25C, beta 3435K, mounted to the cell. Exact NTC and battery pack remain unselected; P_BAT_NTC_HOLD is an interface placeholder." (at 35 258 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "b2518500-0000-4000-8000-000000000070"))
  (text "SYS is 4.5V regulated, not 5V. P_SYS_4V5_HOLD must not connect to the Zero shared USB VBUS/5V pin until board input and reverse-current behaviour are checked." (at 35 266 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "b2518500-0000-4000-8000-000000000071"))
  (text "IN requires >=1uF; SYS >=10uF with >=1uF effective after DC-bias; BAT >=1uF. EP thermal pad layout and all capacitor derating require review." (at 35 274 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "b2518500-0000-4000-8000-000000000072"))
  (text "All P_* nets are HOLD. USB-C CC/ESD, cell protection, thermistor, SYS-to-board conversion/source arbitration and PCB layout are not included. Do not energise." (at 35 282 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0))) (uuid "b2518500-0000-4000-8000-000000000073"))
